      <li><span class="tp-when">2021 – 2023</span><span data-i18n-en="&lt;strong&gt;Head Coach U15&lt;/strong&gt; · EC KAC · Austrian U15 and IHL U15 champions 2022/23"><strong>Head Coach U15</strong> · EC KAC · Meister Österreich U15 und IHL U15 2022/23</span></li>
      <li><span class="tp-when">2019 – 2021</span><span data-i18n-en="&lt;strong&gt;Director of Player Development &amp;amp; Marketing&lt;/strong&gt; · EC Spittal · “Junior Hornets” programme, U8 to U12"><strong>Director of Player Development &amp; Marketing</strong> · EC Spittal · Konzept „Junior Hornets“ U8 bis U12</span></li>
